{"id":20299,"author":"Cyclops","body":"\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 869.984px; padding-top: 15px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span12\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 869.984px; box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eServer Info:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/2b210ed35\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/2b210ed35\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/2b210ed35\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003eDate \u0026amp; Time:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eTuesday, Feburary 16th / 1:30PM EST\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eScenarios:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eMoles\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eTeams of 4/5, at midnight someone is randomly chosen as a 'mole'. The moles objective is to work with the other moles to kill their own teammates and win. Moles have special chats and commands to help communicate with fellow moles. Moles may go into their own teamspeak room, Skype call, etc... if they have been discovered. They are given special items to help them kill their team.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eRisky Retrieval\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e -\u0026nbsp;\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eAn\u0026nbsp;indestructible\u0026nbsp;enderchest will be located at 0,0. When mining diamond/gold, instead of dropping,\u0026nbsp;the product will be transferred to the enderchest. Players will have commands to check how many diamonds/gold they have in the enderchest.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003c/s